el":"","uploader":{"login":"hymkor","id":3752189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxODk=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":1459222,"digest":"sha256:1b67c0bebb061062b6635ddc7d6b984b3e48def49ff7a582054543b4f39a8646","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:23Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:24Z"},{"id":798965998,"node_id":"RA_kwDODPowTM4vn0Du","name":"csvi-v1.26.0-linux-amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"hymkor","id":3752189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxODk=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":1496792,"digest":"sha256:4ec82062de9f8b6ad9384730ce66a4b5ccfff1fa87378e8cfe800fbb9ba53291","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:23Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:24Z"},{"id":798966134,"node_id":"RA_kwDODPowTM4vn0F2","name":"csvi-v1.26.0-windows-386.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"hymkor","id":3752189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxODk=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":1589496,"digest":"sha256:a50e8baea6c32671154bb851935f6b0136e432b57a7ffea0eaf98c82441115a9","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:26Z"},{"id":798966139,"node_id":"RA_kwDODPowTM4vn0F7","name":"csvi-v1.26.0-windows-amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"hymkor","id":3752189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxODk=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":1602763,"digest":"sha256:c6959ccd91815e22e641b0a0cca7962eed54d1569c7b3efcaa3eb3397c6f964a","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:29:26Z"}],"body":"## Changes in v1.26.0 (English)\r\n\r\n- Fix cursor positioning when pressing `End` or `Ctrl`-`E` in cell editing with a prediction displayed (update go-readline-ny to v1.16.2, #123)\r\n- Fixed omission of separators before empty cells when using `-ofs`, while preserving text overflow into empty cells. (#125, #128)\r\n- Ensure all rows are loaded before column cut/copy/paste operations to prevent inconsistent column counts. (#129)\r\n- Add `I` (Shift-i) and `A` (Shift-a) keybindings to insert a column before or after the current column. (#126, #130)\r\n- Add `Meta`+`=` keybinding to fit the all columns to their widest content (#124, #131, #132)\r\n\r\n## Changes in v1.26.0 (Japanese)\r\n\r\n- セル編集で予想表示している際に `End` や `Ctrl`-`E` を押下するとカーソル位置が狂う不具合を修正 ( go-readline-ny を v1.16.2 へ更新, #123)\r\n- `-ofs` 使用中の空セル前の区切り文字の省略ルールを修正し、セルのテキストがオーバーフローした時だけとした。(#125, #128)\r\n- 列のカット、コピー、ペースト時に全行が読み込まれていない場合、完了を待つようにした。(#129)\r\n- 現在の列の前後に新列を挿入するキー `I` (Shift+I), `A` (Shift+A) を追加 (#126, #130)\r\n- 全列の列幅を最大セルの内容に合わせるキー`Meta`+`=` を追加 (#124, #131, #132)\r\n\r\nThanks to @toolleeo","mentions_count":1}
